    "provinceDeepAtlasProfile": {
      "oneLine": "Zharvokh is centered at 73.587529, -60.833104 under Military Regency, with 26,890,000 people across 9 settlements.",
      "extremeAtlasDescription": "Zharvokh occupies  sq mi /  sq km of modeled Earth-sized territory. Its province terrain is led by Mountain range, Deep cavern, Hybrid tree and forest floor. Karag-Thûl, Kharévok, Moltharok, and Tharvokar carry the mountain record: Karag-Thûl occupies the whole mountain section it sits within and descends into caverns with underworld rumors, Kharévok sits between two ranges, Moltharok clings to a mountain side, and Tharvokar is deep mountain.",
      "peopleFactionsAndFaith": "The strongest public people-groups are Humans, Near-Humans, and Mixed Heritage, Halfling and Smallfolk, Animalfolk and Mammalian Anthropomorphs, Dwarven and Gnomish Kin, Amphibious and Aquatic Peoples, Elf Parent Race and Elf Bloodlines, and 2 more. Frequently recorded peoples include Dwarf — Mountain Dwarf, Dwarf — Duergar, Gnome — Deep Gnome, Elf — Drow, Human, Halfling — Lightfoot Halfling, Dwarf — Hill Dwarf, Gnome — Rock Gnome, and 4 more. Faction visibility leans toward The Cog-Sanctum Synod, with worship and patronage records naming Nebyrr, Ishtanora, Iskareth, Marduthor, Bastveig, Setrimir, Sigrananna, and 3 more.",
